{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\Glimpse\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "private-api",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/Service/SmallImagePruner.php:289 OC\\User\\NoUserException",
        "lib/Service/VideoScenes.php:230 OC\\Files\\Storage\\Local"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "2 uses of the private API of the server in 2 files. Only OCP and NCU are public: what is below OC changes without notice between majors.",
        "  lib/Service/SmallImagePruner.php:289 OC\\User\\NoUserException",
        "  lib/Service/VideoScenes.php:230 OC\\Files\\Storage\\Local"
      ]
    },
